      "description": "The data set provides information on the renewable energy share of area-wide mini-grid (PV-battery-diesel) optimizations minimizing LCOE in all countries with a rural electrification rate below 90%. The values are renewable energy in percent of the total energy production. Full information on the creation of the data set can be found here: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.esd.2015.12.007",
